# T_SCRR: the settings screen when its file cannot be written (the
# creation of the scratch file beside it fails): the item order changed
# to LOC and Ctrl-S show the DOS error, and the form keeps the order as
# typed; Esc asks to discard the changes, and Y leaves without saving.
# The adapter and DOS version differ between machines and are masked.
M 8 19 26
M 9 61 18
K TAB TAB TAB SPACE CTRL-S
S SAVEFAIL
K ESC
S LEAVEQ
T Y
